{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2024-03", "window": 2, "start_date": 1709856000, "end_date": 1710547199, "month_true_total": 145, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:04:51 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "160618083", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035698702", "personaname": "xyzcrysis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198035698702/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 1138, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 133, "last_played": 1765325393, "avatar": "5bd53d21159c15d15ca7aabc410a96e9e1dfe6c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yeah it's pretty good. My only request for Space Marine 2 would be to allow players to host their own private matches against Bots. You know like team deathmatch, free-for-all, CTF, capturing zones, etc. but with Bots offline so we don't have to play online with a bunch of try-hards. Maybe add a cover system too?", "timestamp_created": 1710540782, "timestamp_updated": 1712092769, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160608835", "author": {"steamid": "76561198124740606", "personaname": "Strayed Sheep", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198124740606/", "num_games_owned": 286, "num_reviews": 205, "playtime_forever": 1453, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 463, "last_played": 1725513092, "avatar": "2e266d0f2cce3bec803e8fae4658a57ff7b751d5"}, "language": "english", "review": "First off, buy this game on sale like I did. It's a great action game/shooter, but expecting a full $60 for a repackaged version of a decade old game is ridiculous, It feels as if it was done to try and squeeze some cash out of the game before it's sequel comes out in September. With that out of the way though, the game is quite good. It's a short but fun romp through 40k in the big boots of an ultramarine. The game even comes with multiplayer and a horde co-op mode. My only complaint really is that among the space marine chapters you can choose from in multiplayer, the lamenters are absent. Which makes me sad, because they're my favorite.", "timestamp_created": 1710531833, "timestamp_updated": 1710532033, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160607310", "author": {"steamid": "76561199211122275", "personaname": "L0hannes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/L0hannes/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 372, "last_played": 1710715926, "avatar": "28047549398e35648081105115052cca19bbfc7f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Brings Warhammer 40k to life", "timestamp_created": 1710530400, "timestamp_updated": 1710530400, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160603115", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993589983", "personaname": "Madash", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993589983/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 387, "playtime_forever": 516, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 516, "last_played": 1